        "TileImage": "$($repository 47e301d5-e089-4635-8293-b8a1fa69c879).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47, your primary targets are Joanna Coldwell, a touring fashion model, and Roman Gribsch, both of them together, are known as the Photographic Slashers.\r\rThe pair are in Marrakesh to eliminate the photopgrapher that is following with Joanna, she will claim it as an obsessive stalker and will claim Self defense, our client, the photographer&apos;s wife, has hired us to prevent the slashers from killing her husband, and they requested no non-target kills so try to avoid collateral damage!",
